Z||000008||SteveJ||06-19-2001||05:56 PM||||I spent about four hours doing mine in a lesiurly fasion. You buy some "air holds" to pump compressed air in spark plug hole and disassemble the two valves for that cylinder. Just take off the valve cover and disassemble the top end. Doesn't affect the cam. ||||reg||1
